---
// WhyThisWorks.astro - UK specific section explaining the approach
---

<section class="py-20 bg-bg-elevated relative section-fade-in">
  <!-- Gradient divider -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-accent-secondary/50 to-transparent"></div>
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-4">
        Why this approach works for UK service businesses
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-text-secondary max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Most service business owners are too busy doing the work to spend weeks building a website. We handle everything so you can focus on your customers.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
      <!-- The Problem -->
      <div class="glass rounded-xl p-8">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-6">
          The problem we solve
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-text-secondary">
              Potential customers search online but can't find you
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-text-secondary">
              Relying only on word of mouth limits your growth
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-text-secondary">
              DIY website builders take time you don't have
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-text-secondary">
              Agency quotes run into thousands of pounds
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-text-secondary">
              Your competitors are getting found online instead of you
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <!-- The Solution -->
      <div class="glass rounded-xl p-8 border-accent-primary/30">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-6">
          How we help
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-primary mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-text-secondary">
              We build your website for you — no technical skills needed
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-primary mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-text-secondary">
              Designed to appear in local search results for your area
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-primary mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-text-secondary">
              Mobile-friendly so customers can contact you from their phone
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-primary mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-text-secondary">
              Built to generate enquiries, not just look pretty
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-primary mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-text-secondary">
              Ongoing support so you're never left on your own
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
